      "content": "That makes sense. To ensure the SOP is bulletproof, can you expand on the specific metabolic triggers that cause the spore coat to become permeable at those specific temperatures? I need to explain to the audit team exactly what is happening at a cellular level to justify our rapid-cooling window.",
